00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:41.490
And we want to also do that for
their immediate family.

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:44.230
So that was the very first consideration.

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:52.010
The next thing we wanted to do
was make sure that we were making

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:57.240
